    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54981" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταργῠρ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cover with silver, silver over</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philoch.
				138
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταργυρωμένους</span> (
				Ion.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατηργ-</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἔχων τοὺς προμαχεῶνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.98
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.57
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>buy</i> or <i>bribe with silver</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄθρησον εἰ κατηργυρωμένος λέγω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1077
				</span></i>
			.</div>
